WEBVTT

00:11:58.922 --> 00:12:00.883
This is not rocket science.

00:12:01.508 --> 00:12:04.720
It just requires caring a little bit more

00:12:04.762 --> 00:12:06.847
and trying a little bit harder.

00:12:07.931 --> 00:12:09.641
Being present,

00:12:09.683 --> 00:12:12.311
not taking yourself too seriously

00:12:12.352 --> 00:12:14.772
and remembering that one size fits one.

00:12:15.689 --> 00:12:16.815
Just go with me here.

00:12:16.857 --> 00:12:19.860
Imagine if the person that checked you
into the dentist's office

00:12:19.902 --> 00:12:21.236
started thinking like this.

00:12:21.236 --> 00:12:24.907
Imagine if the person that sold you
your next car started thinking like this.

00:12:24.907 --> 00:12:28.076
Or better yet, imagine if everyone
on your entire team

00:12:28.118 --> 00:12:29.787
started thinking like this.